msgid "Description"
msgstr "Popis"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/drawgrid.rst:43
msgid "This effect/filter draws a colored grid on the input video."
msgstr "Tento efekt/filter vykreslí farebnú mriežku na vstupné video."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/drawgrid.rst:47
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Parametre"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/drawgrid.rst:54
msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "Parameter"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/drawgrid.rst:55
msgid "Value"
msgstr "Hodnota"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/drawgrid.rst:57
msgid "Color"
msgstr "Farba"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/drawgrid.rst:58
msgid "Picker"
msgstr "Výberník"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/drawgrid.rst:59
msgid "Defines the color for the box"
msgstr "Definuje farbu rámčeka"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/drawgrid.rst:60
msgid "Replace color and alpha"
msgstr "Nahradiť farbu a alfa kanál"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/drawgrid.rst:61
msgid "Switch"
msgstr "Prepnúť"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/drawgrid.rst:62
msgid ""
"If the input has alpha, checking this    will overwrite the video's color "
"and alpha pixels with the pixels of the painted box. By default (off), the "
"box will be composited onto the input, leaving the video's alpha intact."
msgstr ""
"Ak má vstup alfa kanál, zaškrtnutím tohto prepíše farbu a alfa pixely videa "
"pixelmi nakresleného rámčeka. Predvolene (vypnuté) bude rámček kompozitovaný "
"na vstup, pričom alfa kanál videa zostane neporušený."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/drawgrid.rst:63
msgid "X / Y Offset"
msgstr "Posun X / Y"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/drawgrid.rst:64
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/drawgrid.rst:67
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/drawgrid.rst:70
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/drawgrid.rst:73
msgid "Integer"
msgstr "Celé číslo"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/drawgrid.rst:65
msgid ""
"Defines the starting point of the grid in pixels from the top left-hand "
"corner of the monitor (coordinates are based on the project dimension "
"settings)"
msgstr ""
"Definuje počiatočný bod mriežky v pixeloch od ľavého horného rohu monitora "
"(súradnice sú založené na nastaveniach rozmerov projektu)"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/drawgrid.rst:66
msgid "Width"
msgstr "Šírka"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/drawgrid.rst:68
msgid "Defines the distance between vertical grid lines in pixels"
msgstr "Definuje vzdialenosť medzi zvislými čiarami mriežky v pixeloch"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/drawgrid.rst:69
msgid "Height"
msgstr "Výška"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/drawgrid.rst:71
msgid "Defines the distance between horizontal grid lines in pixels"
msgstr "Definuje vzdialenosť medzi vodorovnými čiarami mriežky v pixeloch"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/drawgrid.rst:72
msgid "Thickness (px)"
msgstr "Hrúbka čiary"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/drawgrid.rst:74
msgid ""
"Defines the thickness of the line in pixels. If set high enough, the grid is "
"essentially filled."
msgstr ""
"Definuje hrúbku čiary v pixeloch. Ak je nastavená dostatočne vysoko, mriežka "
"je v podstate vyplnená."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/drawgrid.rst:78
msgid ""
"This effect can be used in combination with the :doc:`/effects_and_filters/"
"video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/chroma_key` or :doc:`/effects_and_filters/"
"video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/chroma_key_advanced` effects to create "
"interesting transitions by animating the number of grid lines and their "
"thickness."
msgstr ""
"Tento efekt možno použiť v kombinácii s efektmi :doc:`/effects_and_filters/"
"video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/chroma_key` alebo :doc:`/effects_and_filters/"
"video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/chroma_key_advanced` na vytváranie "
"zaujímavých prechodov animovaním počtu čiar mriežky a ich hrúbky."
